## Why This Is Asked

Tests the ability to translate a performance problem into a concrete, actionable plan with beginner-level scope.

## Key Concepts

- Telemetry-driven optimization
- Safe experiments with feature flags
- Incident response basics
- Stakeholder communication

## Code Example

```javascript
// Tiny cache helper for hot paths
const cache = new Map();
async function getCached(key, fetch){
  if (cache.has(key)) return cache.get(key);
  const val = await fetch();
  cache.set(key, val);
  return val;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you measure success if latency improvements reduce throughput?
- What would you change if a third-party dependency introduces higher error rates after caching is added?
